This tool invokes, as a dependency, the official Model Context Protocol
conformance suite (@modelcontextprotocol/conformance) and reads the
`requirements/<revision>.yaml` file it ships. Remediation messages quote
short passages of the Model Context Protocol specification, revision
2026-07-28. Both are:

